# Working data for the citation sweep, not source. The repo root already
# ignores *.json (scan/diag/verify output); these are the rest of the churn:
# page dumps, extracted Background text, run logs, and console captures.
# Per-country fix specs (fix_<country>.py) stay visible — they are the record
# of what each batch changed — as do the shared fixlib.py / scan_*.py.
*.wiki
*_bg.txt
*.jsonl
*.log
*.err
*.bak

# per-batch diagnostic dumps (india/bangladesh left these behind)
_diag_*/

# per-batch scratch: pickled diffs/plans and the save/wayback/plan/recheck
# drivers. Only the fix_<country>.py specs are the durable record.
*.pkl
save_*.py
wb_*.py
plan_*.py
recheck_*.py
